1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,718
How do you turn a YouTube VOD into Shorts?

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:05,331
Drop the URL into ClipMe.

3
00:00:05,331 --> 00:00:10,897
It scores the whole video, pulls the best moments, and renders them as captioned Shorts.

4
00:00:11,847 --> 00:00:14,740
A long stream is full of Shorts you haven't cut yet.

5
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:17,799
The hard part is finding which 40 seconds are worth it.

6
00:00:18,749 --> 00:00:27,005
ClipMe ranks every moment, then renders the best ones as vertical Shorts, and Pro adds 4:5, 1:1 and the original shape.

7
00:00:27,955 --> 00:00:28,786
Honest note.

8
00:00:28,786 --> 00:00:33,009
For talking-head podcasts, tools like OpusClip are excellent.

9
00:00:33,009 --> 00:00:35,571
ClipMe is built for long stream VODs.

10
00:00:36,521 --> 00:00:38,334
Try it free at clipme.com.

